  "description": {
    "text": "7-Eleven stores. In Japan they sold the Official Deck Case Arceus (オフィシャルデッキケース アルセウス) only at 7-Eleven from 8 July 2009, the release day of the Advent of Arceus expansion, as a set with its divider and an original holo Arceus, 040/DPt-P. Stellar Crown's Lapras carries a 7-Eleven stamp. The 2003 Pokémon Fair cards are under 7-Eleven Pokémon Fair. In Japan from late June 2017, 7-Eleven stores gave Togedemaru 110/SM-P, with no logo, for every five booster packs bought in one transaction. From 25 December 2012, 7-Eleven stores in Japan gave one of four promos with no logo, among them Zebstrika 199/BW-P and Liepard 200/BW-P, for four packs of the Black & White expansions of 2012."
  },
